// Master E19.4 Conformance Probe (`T815` / `SPEC-103` `AXS-DIAG-001..022`, `AXS-AI-001..021`,
// `AXS-DIAG-050..053`; `INV-DIAG-009..011`; `REQ-TOOL-004`, `REQ-TOOL-180..182`, `REQ-TOOL-185..187`,
// `REQ-TOOL-190`, `REQ-TOOL-298`):
// Directly exercises the live `std.meta_effects`, `compiler.diag.ux2`, `compiler.diag.explain`,
// `compiler.driver.explain_cmd`, `compiler.ai_query`, and `compiler.driver.query_cmd` modules.

